tip: | Look at the two materials. | Clay and leaf each have a ramp of their own. The pot runs along Brick and the plant along Greens, and no color is shared, so they stay apart.
tip: 2 | One flat color each. | Before any shading, each material gets the middle step of its ramp. Decide what is made of what here.
tip: | Try it. | Pick Lighten / Darken and stroke across the pot, then across a leaf. Each stays on its own ramp, so clay stays clay and leaf stays leaf. | shade
